<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="overscroll-none">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link href="/assets/style.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <title>J. Majewski</title>
</head>

<body class="text-slate-200 font-sans bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-500 to-violet-700 min-h-screen">
    <h1 class="justify-center text-5xl my-2 font-bold font-sans drop-shadow-2xl text-center">Jane Majewski's Portfolio
    </h1><br>

    <div class="flex flex-row justify-center">
        <div id="projects" class="lg:max-w-[75vw]">
            <div class="projectList grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 justify-items-center items-start gap-y-5">
                <div
                    class="project flex flex-col w-2/3 content-center items-center border-0 rounded-2xl p-2 py-4 drop-shadow-lg hover:drop-shadow-xl transition duration-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-300 to-violet-500">
                    <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/j8VmKBsoX6I" title="Ghost Hunt Cold Open" frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                        referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                        class="w-full aspect-video projectPic rounded-2xl drop-shadow-sm" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                    <h2 class='projectTitle text-center text-3xl font-bold'>Ghost Hunt [WIP]</h2>
                    <h3 class='projectRole text-center text-xl font-semibold'>Showrunner, Writer, Director and
                        On-Camera
                        Talent</h3>
                    <hr class="border-4 border-slate-200 cursor-pointer rounded-full my-2">
                    </hr>
                    <p class='projectDesc text-center pb-2 text-slate-200'>Two ghost hunters argue through a reality
                        show in a world without ghosts</p>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="project flex flex-col w-2/3 content-center items-center border-0 rounded-2xl p-2 py-4 drop-shadow-lg hover:drop-shadow-xl transition duration-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-violet-300 to-violet-500">
                    <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/1X3lYbioR6c"
                        title="Jackson and Anthony: Ghost and Ghoul Hunters" frameborder="0"
                        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                        referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                        class="w-full aspect-video projectPic rounded-2xl drop-shadow-sm" allowfullscreen></iframe>
                    <h2 class='projectTitle text-center text-3xl font-bold'>Jackson and Anthony: Ghost and Ghoul Hunters
                    </h2>
                    <h3 class='projectRole text-center text-xl font-semibold'>Writer, Director, Video Editor, and On-Camera Talent</h3>
                    <hr class="border-4 border-slate-200 cursor-pointer rounded-full my-2">
                    </hr>
                    <p class='projectDesc text-center pb-2 text-slate-200'>Made to look like a cheap, poorly made local ad, JA:GGH at one time had a working website and phone number. The edited footage was bounced to a VHS tape.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-center mt-2 sticky top-[97vh]">&copy2026 J. Majewski • <a
            href="https://github.com/fufihiuse/portfolio" class="hover:underline decoration-1" target="_blank">View
            Source</a></p>
    <script src="/assets/appBundle.js"></script>
</body>

</html>